                  <adminInfo>
                     <availability>
                        <p>available</p>
                     </availability>
                     <note type="comment">The cover page of the manuscript (ID:4604) gives the title "dbu ma'i man ngag gi 'bum," but based on the contents, it is likely that it was switched with the cover page of (ID:4602), with the title "bden gnyis kyi 'bum". ([4W5HW75B]: 21-22)&#13;
&#13;
The signature for the page with the title "bden gnyis kyi 'bum" ([Z5AUD7GQ]: 335) is hardly readable. [8H6M69W4], reports the signature "phyi tsa 22" for both No. 15400 (in 18 folios) (see (ID:4602)) and No. 15401 (in 16 fols.).&#13;
&#13;
Before the false cover page, the recto of another cover page is reproduced in [Z5AUD7GQ]: 370, bearing only the signature "phyi tsa 82" and the letter "ta" in the left margin. In [Z5AUD7GQ]: 86, the signature "phyi tsa 82" is associated with an "dbu ma bden gnyis kyi 'grel ba" and a "dbu ma'i man ngag gi 'grel ba" (referring to (ID:4602) and (ID:4604)?), but it probably belongs to another manuscript.</note>
                  </adminInfo>
